& [Requirements]
  + [SAC4C-001] whole-replay the Slice4B2C gate before projection
  + [SAC4C-002] project every Eligible scanner candidate and no other candidate from exact admitted SemanticUnit data
  + [SAC4C-003] support only Term Definition Description and SourceSpan with explicit returned accounts
  + [SAC4C-004] retain unit identity digest kind status eligibility and requested exact fields under canonical order
  + [SAC4C-005] enforce positive hard-capped complete record and serialized-byte budgets without clipping
  + [SAC4C-006] bind gate request gate result roots requested details budget records accounts omissions and non-authority boundary into a proof digest
  + [SAC4C-007] strict structural validation and whole canonical replay refuse mutation
  + [SAC4C-008] optional direct equivalence first re-executes and exactly matches the existing CantorQueryResult
  + [SAC4C-009] direct overlap requires exact identity terms equal eligible ids exact search no selectors or relation traversal compatible fields scopes and read-only authority
  + [SAC4C-010] equivalence compares eligible ids and every projected field exactly and emits a proof-bound field-scoped witness
  + [SAC4C-011] repeat inputs produce byte-identical outputs and measured compact versus direct serialized bytes
  + [SAC4C-012] no scanner query-engine public protocol CLI provider effect persistence remote FPGA or Minecraft modification

& [Acceptance]
  + positive projection and equivalence fixtures pass
  + excluded and unauthorized candidates never project
  + unsupported detail budget root field direct request and direct result mutations refuse
  + focused debug release unchanged scanner direct-query regression workspace Clippy format evidence and diff gates pass

